And precisely because you have every right to feel that way, seeing Melachi look forward is incredible, and if there's anything I can do, I want to do whatever it takes.

2175
01:37:49,852 --> 01:37:50,652
うん。
Yeah.

2176
01:37:51,752 --> 01:37:52,552
うん。
Yeah.

2177
01:37:55,702 --> 01:37:56,652
ああー。
