2186
01:38:11,152 --> 01:38:11,852
うん。
Yeah.

2187
01:38:14,052 --> 01:38:14,752
うん。
Yeah.

2188
01:38:14,902 --> 01:38:17,652
ちょっと、あの、あるじゃん？2次会のあの冷静な会話。
and you know that calm conversation you have at the after-party?

2189
